  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Rest, Revive and Rejoice at Inlet Beach with a family friendly and peaceful atmosphere for a fun filled vacation! <br><br>Pool in the backyard exclusively for R3 guests shared with one other house across the street. Hot Spa and Pool heating package not included with the base rate.<br><br>Beach Bikes, Chairs, Umbrella, Wagon included with the house.<br><br>Plenty of private parking space to hold your RV, Boat, Trailer or up to 7 vehicles.<br><br>Three blocks of walking distance to the best beach access of 30A with plenty of eating choices around.<br><br>Walk, bike or ride in a golf cart to the beach and restaurants, start exploring 30A starting from Inlet Beach through Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, Water Sound all the way to 30A on the other end!<br><br>Independent home with plenty of space in the front and the back. Fully renewed in 2024 with interiors and exteriors - 3 bed, 2 full bath and a large deck in the front.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "R3 Orange at Inlet Beach with Pool and EV/RV Charger"
        }
